Title: A video frame grabber device driver Cortex I on Linux

Version: 0.1

Description: This is a device driver for the ImageNation Cortex I video
capture card. This is a 512 by 486 resolution 8bit gray scale video capture
card. It is ISA bus so I only get about 5 full frames per second.

Author: Cullen Jennings

AuthorEmail: cullen@image.wimsey.com

