		with a useful collection of utilities including a Standard MIDI
		File replayer and recorder.

		Numerous improvements have been made since version 0.11a. Among
		other things, the driver now features IRQ sharing policy and
		complies with the new kernel module interface.

		Metronome functionality, possibility for synchronizing
