DISTRIBUTION
    The system is distributed in a 3.5" flopy with a 185 page hardcopy 
    of the on-line hypertext of the Auto-Tutor. Since the 87 tutorials
    are in fact shell scripts, thus they don't take up much space.

PRICING:
